<title>USA: First Keystone Financial Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>First Keystone Financial Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEDIA, Pa. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.60		    $0.40</p>
<p> Net			    653			480</p>
<p> Provision for		 60			 37</p>
<p>loan losses</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 1,228		    1,293</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.11		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			  1,268			627</p>
<p> Provision for		116			 75</p>
<p>loan losses</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 1,228		    1,293</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q2 and six-month 1997 results were improved by yield enhancement and operating expense reduction.</p>
<p>The company said it completed a $1.3 million stock repurchase of 64,625 common shares at $19.625 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is First Keystone Financial Inc.</p>
